{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_6_level_main_06-08_beg","groupId":"main_6","stageId":"main_06-08","title":"換一個角度","storyCode":"6-9","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_06-08_beg.txt","sourceHash":"0ba755c84fe4a05a19fc31aaaee55421dfaff787dd645df714e11d5c286854a6","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"時間回到現在。整合運動似乎又找到了主心骨，名為九的女性選擇離開龍門。而陳決定將雨披部隊引向雪怪小隊。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第四关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"可我們並不熟這裡的構造，我害怕......感染者會針對我們行動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，我很熟悉這裡。聽我的指揮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"Yes sir！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"陳sir，有個不太好的消息。根據各處的通報，整合運動的行動又變得有條理了起來，就像重新找到了指揮官一樣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"他們......他們還調整了既有頻道，重置了加密，我們沒法再追蹤他們的通訊了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......難道他們和貧民區裡的隊伍會合了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"不可能，我已經收到消息說羅德島處理好了貧民區裡的事情，這才讓我們得以不被裡外夾擊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"奇怪......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"阿陳，我準備——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"通訊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"“小姐”，麻煩你去那邊等我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼每次時間都卡這麼準非要在我有事找你的時候有事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"線人連上了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你快去。下次給你買鱗魚蛋吃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"你當我小孩嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......我是陳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有新的整合運動成員從貧民區下層過來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"被稱作是雪怪小隊的感染者，似乎有毀壞建築物、摧毀城市基礎結構的能力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"務必小心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Only-1，有隸屬龍門的特殊部隊在貧民區活動。我們還暫時沒法阻止他們。你要注意安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......Only-1，之前為什麼沒有發送定時通信？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我在想一些事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"現在我想清楚了，龍門就拜託你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？我不理解你的意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"現在的我，早已經不再屬於這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Only-1！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我會帶一些龍門的感染者走。近衛局沒法保護他們，這座城市不在乎他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"或者說，即使你是這麼想的，這座城市也並不如你所願。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"九！服從命令！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......三年前起，我就不屬於近衛局了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"再說，原本，理應是我命令你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"九......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你說的特殊部隊，我似乎已經看見過了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我還是把龍門想像得太好了。再見，陳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"對了，別去檢查排水系統。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我聲音是不是太大了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"那確實特別大，我感覺一條街都聽見了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼也沒你的嗓門大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，阿陳，你過來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"坐啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Miss詩懷雅居然不顧形象、不怕裙子髒，就這樣子蹲坐在街邊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"無所謂啦！你怎麼覺得我會在意那種事的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"......我準備再給那隻下水道老鼠打個電話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然我沒怎麼來過這裡，但我覺得特殊部隊一定在做可怕的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你見過貧民區的林嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"我見過。是個很和善的老人，比我爺爺好多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......他可是“鼠王”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"這幾個人不都這樣。但他真的是個好人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是沒想到雨霞她會變成現在這個樣子。明明以前是個又膽小又靦腆的孩子，經常躲在你背後來著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我倒覺得她沒有變。她只是......擔負起了責任。也許並不該屬於她的責任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"就算你這麼提醒她，也沒用。我們已經被架在火上烤了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"她和她父親的事情，我也沒有頭緒。只不過，她不會是那種冷血的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我想再打個電話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"也許剛才的消息可以幫到我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼說的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"一支有著特殊能力的整合運動力量進入了貧民區，他們甚至能指揮現在的整合運動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"這個消息只有我知道。現在，只有我們兩個知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"你打算怎麼做？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"把雨披引向他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"除了留在外面和近衛局一起清理特殊感染者的，不少特殊部隊已經和我們同時進入了貧民區。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"就算這樣，我們也依然不知道他們的力量分佈，也沒法防範他們，不知道他們會做出什麼事來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"但你可以透過林雨霞，把他們引到這支整合運動小隊那裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"逼他們出來？讓所有近衛局的成員都看見？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"讓所有近衛局的成員都看見。甚至，讓羅德島也看見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"你現在這麼信任他們？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"他們比我見過的任何人都專注於自己的目標，比近衛局還要誠實。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我們也沒有什麼可以信任的人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"你膽子真大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"龍門人不知道什麼林，不怎麼認識你的祖父，也不太清楚魏彥吾是誰，更別說底下那些商會什麼的了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"龍門人只相信近衛局。這幾個人沒有人敢冒風險真的抹除龍門近衛局，只留下普通警力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"再加上外人......這個秤砣會重到他們不敢接手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"你會被撤職哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"也挺好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"那就痛快做完這最後一班活吧！下次，我要讓他們把巡邏路線排進貧民區。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"林會不會接受？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"只要我們能保下這裡，林肯定接受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"對了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你知不知道我們有三位客人？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"臭老鼠，有個消息給你。有支整合運動，我們現在擋不住，需要你那支隊伍的幫助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"......怎麼可能？不要騙我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我騙過你嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"你和我說要和我上同一所中學，結果你去了維多利亞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"對不起。實在對不起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼，我不在意了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"雨霞，你爸為龍門做了很多。我們不想失去這裡，這裡的居民也不能失去我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"騙子。你會來這裡嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"你會來貧民區嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......陳會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"......你還真不會騙人啊。她，關我什麼事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你爸出於一些原因，不能夠直接著手調解普通人和感染者的矛盾，但陳會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"陳和你的父親一起調理著貧民區。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他們在努力讓貧民區變成一個可以讓更多人生活的地方，甚至是甩掉貧民區這個名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你想......雖然龍門的普通市民很少居住在這，但是過去這些年裡，他們不也經常來這裡嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"再過一些時間，我們就不需要貧民區了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"雖然感染者的問題我們還沒法解決，但我相信......這裡可以變成一個更好的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只是龍門的22到29下城區，而不是什麼“貧民區”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這個城市本來就是因為能容納許許多多、各種各樣的人，才發展成現在這個樣子的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"龍門不能失去任何人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"......無聊。你變得和那個陳一樣無聊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"雨霞......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哎，我不想把氣氛搞得像是垃圾終端連續劇一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"那支整合運動的位置在哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊，啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"我不會說第二次的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，你們已經進入貧民區了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"現在的情況十分特殊。你們應該知情。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["陳"]},{"speakerId":"char_015_lmg","aliases":["近衛局成員"]},{"speakerId":"char_308_swire","aliases":["詩懷雅"]}]}
